      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">RESULT</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Branch:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">design/photographer-directory-role</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Page:</strong> <a href=\"http://localhost:3002/photographer-directory\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://localhost:3002/photographer-directory</a></p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-e68bacd6-6af2-42fa-8668-429821f49866.png\"><img width=\"1680\" height=\"988\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-e68bacd6-6af2-42fa-8668-429821f49866.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 988px;; aspect-ratio: 1680 / 988; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-901d22fc-275f-4e8e-a644-efba5843fe48.png\"><img width=\"1674\" height=\"976\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-901d22fc-275f-4e8e-a644-efba5843fe48.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 976px;; aspect-ratio: 1674 / 976; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">PRD 5.1 + 5.2 — role model and apply payload.</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API value</th>\n<th>UI label</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">photographer_360</code></td>\n<td>360 Photographer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">image_processing</code></td>\n<td>Image Processing</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Central role constants <code class=\"notranslate\">photographer_360</code> / <code class=\"notranslate\">image_processing</code> + API-to-label mapping reused everywhere</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Equipment type constants: 1 Drone, 2 360 Camera, 3 DSLR, 4 3D Scanner, 5 Software</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> No request sends non-canonical values (<code class=\"notranslate\">360_photographer</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">image_editor</code>)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Applicant must choose one role before applying</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Apply payload includes <code class=\"notranslate\">role</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">timezone</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">language</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Defaults <code class=\"notranslate\">America/Toronto</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">English</code> when those fields are not shown</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Successful apply navigates to the existing profile flow</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Backend validation errors for role/timezone/language are surfaced</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Locale keys: 360 Photographer, Image Processing, Role</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Unit test for role constants + label mapping</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ref: <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-16-52/prd.md</code> · <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-16-52/brief.md</code></p>",
