      "display_title": "Issue #4200: Photographer Profile Page",
      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">RESULT</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Branch:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">design/photographer-directory-role</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Page:</strong> <a href=\"http://localhost:3002/photographer/profile\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://localhost:3002/photographer/profile</a></p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-06bc4238-aaec-45d4-9407-c8c1b85fafd1.png\"><img width=\"1375\" height=\"925\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-06bc4238-aaec-45d4-9407-c8c1b85fafd1.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 925px;; aspect-ratio: 1375 / 925; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">PRD 5.3 + 5.4 — required role data, catalog-backed controls, role-change reset.</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Role dropdown (canonical values)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Timezone dropdown from <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /v1/photographers/timezones</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Language multi-select from <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /v1/photographers/languages</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Language saved as CSV text (<code class=\"notranslate\">\"English,French\"</code>), never a JSON array; trim values, no blank tokens</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Services filtered by selected role from <code class=\"notranslate\">GET /v1/photographers/services</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Profile save sends <code class=\"notranslate\">role</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">timezone</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">language</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">services</code> + existing fields</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Required-field validation before save (role, timezone, language, services)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Role-change warning before save: <em>Changing role will clear the services and tools saved for your current role. You can add new role-compatible services and tools after saving.</em></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Incompatible service IDs removed from selection and never sent</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> After role-change save, refetch profile services and equipment; no stale tools shown as active</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Locale keys: Role, Timezone, Language, role-change warning, missing service labels</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tests for CSV parse/serialize helpers</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ref: <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-16-52/prd.md</code> · <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-16-52/brief.md</code></p>",
