box\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Gear tab for <code class=\"notranslate\">photographer_360</code>: Drone, 360 Camera, DSLR, 3D Scanner (Name, Brand, Key specification)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Gear tab for <code class=\"notranslate\">image_processing</code>: Software only (Name, Level, Description)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Role-specific empty states</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Approve/deny workflow unchanged</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Locale keys: support role column, Review Profile/Gear labels</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ref: <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-16-52/prd.md</code> · <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-16-52/brief.md</code></p>",
